<title>EGYPT: North Cairo Q3 96/7 pre-tax at $26.5 mln.</title>
<headline>North Cairo Q3 96/7 pre-tax at $26.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which began on July 1, 1996 and ends on June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures</p>
<p>available)</p>
<p>					  July96-March97</p>
<p> Net sales				671,104,000</p>
<p> Production costs		     578,974,000</p>
<p> Overheads				 17,608,000</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues		  16,334,000</p>
<p> Exceptional expenditure		  780,000</p>
<p> Net profit before tax		 90,076,000</p>
<p>Full company name is North Cairo Flour Mills.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
